sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Manager
    participant UI as Browser
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant R as Redis / Celery
    participant W as Scheduling worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant S as Selected solver
    M->>UI: Select jobs, strategy and planning start
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/schedules
    API->>API: Authenticate manager and validate body
    API->>R: Enqueue strategy-specific task
    API-->>UI: 202 generation ID + status URL
    R->>W: Deliver task
    W->>DB: Read selected jobs and floor in short transaction
    DB-->>W: Input snapshot / selection issues
    W->>W: Validate selection and strategy support
    alt Invalid input or unsupported shape
      W-->>R: invalid + structured issues
    else Valid input
      W->>S: Solve outside transaction
      alt Runtime or licence unavailable
        S-->>W: Unavailable
        W-->>R: unavailable
      else Feasible plan
        S-->>W: Assignments, timing, dependencies, metrics
        W->>DB: Write draft, entries and selections, commit
        DB-->>W: Schedule ID
        W-->>R: stored + schedule ID
      end
    end
    loop Until terminal status
      UI->>API: GET /api/v1/schedules/generations/{id}
      API->>R: Read AsyncResult
      R-->>API: Task state / result
      API-->>UI: pending / running / completed / rejected / unavailable / failed
    end
    opt Completed generation
      UI->>API: GET /api/v1/schedules/{id}
      API->>DB: Read saved draft
      DB-->>API: Schedule and assignments
      API-->>UI: Draft for review
      M->>UI: Confirm reviewed schedule
      UI->>API: PATCH /api/v1/schedules/{id} status=confirmed
      API->>DB: Check lifecycle and job conflicts, commit confirmation
      API-->>UI: Confirmed schedule or conflict
    end
